# Kept out of git, as the first two runs' were: the recordings (snapshots and engine results, about 3 MB a
# page), screenshots, judgment and destination caches, and image crops. data/recordings.json has the size and
# SHA-256 of every recording file, so a copy kept elsewhere can be checked before judgments are re-run on it.
pages/*/recording/
pages/*/probe-recording/
pages/*/*.png
pages/*/cache/
pages/*/cache-*/
pages/*/.rampa/
pages/*/*-collect.json
packets/*/
